@startuml
title Tobii ET5 to Star Citizen Stock Tobii Runtime

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

component "Tobii ET5 / EyeChip\nphysical USB device\nUSB 2104:0313" as Tobii

node "Linux host" as Linux {
  component "tobii-ttp-mux\nlibusb interface 0" as Mux
  component "eye-pose-dashboard.py\noptional UI client" as Dashboard
  component "tracking-service.py + TrackingEngine\ncapture, calibration, filtering, output" as Engine
  component "MediaPipe Face Landmarker\nPython 3.11/3.12 venv worker" as MediaPipe
  artifact ".tmp/sc-tobii-native-runtime/sc-tuning.json\nquick tuning" as Tuning
  artifact ".tmp/sc-tobii-native-runtime/native-head-position.json\npersonal head-position profile" as HeadCal
  artifact ".tmp/sc-tobii-native-runtime/sc-window.json\nwindow geometry" as WindowState
}

node "Linux compatibility services" as Services {
  component "run-sc-tobii-native-runtime.sh\nservice supervisor" as Supervisor
  component "tobii-middleware-spy.py\nTobii TCP middleware emulator\n127.0.0.1:4455" as TcpMiddleware
  component "tobii-middleware-pipe-spy.exe\nWine SESP pipe emulator\nhead pose provider" as SespPipe
  component "ETDefaultPIPE discovery pipe" as ETDefault
  component "TOBII-* discovery marker pipe" as TobiiPipe
  component "TOBIIPRP-* discovery marker pipe" as PrpPipe
  component "analyze-sc-tobii-runtime-logs.py\nstatus and adoption analyzer" as Analyzer
}

node "Star Citizen Wine prefix" as Wine {
  component "stock tobii_gameintegration_x64.dll\nbundled with Star Citizen" as StockDll
  component "StarCitizen.exe\nHeadtrackingSource=Tobii" as SC
}

Tobii --> Mux : USB vendor/TTP via libusb\ninterface 0\nEP 0x83 in, EP 0x05 out
Mux --> Engine : gaze + eye-origin stream\n0x0500 / native gaze rows
Mux --> Engine : in-band IR image stream\n0x050e
Mux --> Engine : sync/timing stream\n0x1771

TcpMiddleware ..> Engine : subscription demand / disconnect\nUDP loopback 4244
SespPipe ..> Engine : head-pose start / stop / disconnect\nUDP loopback 4244
Engine ..> Mux : start / stop capture\nAuto demand or manual controls

Engine --> MediaPipe : 280x280 IR frames\npreprocess + timestamps
MediaPipe --> Engine : face landmarks\npose + confidence + latency

Engine --> Tuning : save slider changes
Tuning --> Engine : restore on launch
HeadCal --> Engine : restore on launch
Engine --> WindowState : save size/position
WindowState --> Engine : restore on launch

Engine --> SespPipe : UDP double[12]\nhead-pose target 127.0.0.1:4243\nx,y,z,yaw,pitch,roll,source,counter
Engine --> TcpMiddleware : UDP double[12]\nlive-gaze target 127.0.0.1:4457\ngaze_x,gaze_y,gaze_valid

Dashboard <--> Engine : private Unix socket\nstatus, tuning, calibration commands
Supervisor --> Engine : start / monitor / restart
Supervisor --> TcpMiddleware : start / restart / log
Supervisor --> SespPipe : start under Wine prefix
Supervisor --> ETDefault : start under Wine prefix
Supervisor --> TobiiPipe : start under Wine prefix
Supervisor --> PrpPipe : start under Wine prefix

ETDefault --> StockDll : Wine named pipe discovery\n\\\\.\\pipe\\ETDefaultPIPE
TobiiPipe --> StockDll : Wine named pipe discovery\n\\\\.\\pipe\\TOBII-127.0.0.1
PrpPipe --> StockDll : Wine named pipe discovery\n\\\\.\\pipe\\TOBIIPRP-<serial>

StockDll --> TcpMiddleware : TCP TTP / middleware protocol\nhello, discovery, display area,\nruntime metadata, subscriptions
TcpMiddleware --> StockDll : device metadata + capabilities\npresence stream 0x0504\ngaze stream 0x0500
TcpMiddleware --> StockDll : async gaze events\nfrom service live gaze UDP

StockDll --> SespPipe : SESP provider pipe\ninitialize, display info,\nfeature/status, head-pose channel
SespPipe --> StockDll : display/provider replies\nlive head pose events

SC --> StockDll : load bundled DLL\nGetApi / TrackWindow / Update
StockDll --> SC : native Tobii head pose\ngaze point / target selection

Analyzer ..> TcpMiddleware : read middleware-spy.log
Analyzer ..> SespPipe : read middleware-pipe-spy.log
Analyzer ..> ETDefault : read discovery logs
Analyzer ..> TobiiPipe : read discovery logs
Analyzer ..> PrpPipe : read discovery logs

note bottom of StockDll
The normal runtime path uses the stock game DLL.
No Star Citizen Bin64 files are modified.
No process injection is required.
end note

note bottom of Engine
Pose and gaze are independent:
head position uses native eyes + rotation compensation
when a personal profile is available; missing pairs hold.
Head pose is smoothed/tuned for cockpit camera,
gaze remains responsive for target selection.
end note

note bottom of Dashboard
Closing the dashboard leaves active tracking running.
No USB reader or inference worker belongs to the UI.
end note

@enduml
